<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:05.239" end="00:00:07.259" style="s2">[crying and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.600" end="00:00:12.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, my lady. It&#39;s a girl.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.000" end="00:00:15.800" style="s2">Let me hold her.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.100" end="00:00:21.300" style="s2">I&#39;ll take the little miss to see the</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.400" end="00:00:21.300" style="s2">duke and be right back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.100" end="00:00:47.800" style="s2">Is this baby going to make our lives</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.500" end="00:00:50.300" style="s2">better?</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.800" end="00:00:53.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your daughter was born unlucky.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.300" end="00:00:57.100" style="s2">She&#39;ll only bring disaster.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.600" end="00:00:57.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about that [ __ ] Isabella&#39;s kid?</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.500" end="00:01:01.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isabella&#39;s daughter has lady luck on her</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.700" end="00:01:03.700" style="s2">side. She brings good luck to everyone</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.900" end="00:01:05.300" style="s2">around her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.700" end="00:01:07.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re good luck, so you&#39;re staying with</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.300" end="00:01:10.900" style="s2">me. My daughter goes to the duke&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.200" end="00:01:10.900" style="s2">estate. She&#39;ll be the real little lady.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.500" end="00:01:18.600" style="s2">I thought I saw a mark by her temple.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.000" end="00:01:20.620" style="s2">Did I imagine it?</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.600" end="00:01:20.620" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.840" end="00:01:25.860" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.045" end="00:01:35.200" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:32.000" end="00:01:38.000" style="s2">Quickly, don&#39;t let the lady see.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.200" end="00:01:38.000" style="s2">Thank you, miss.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.216" end="00:01:42.236" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.300" end="00:01:47.600" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this the ring I&#39;ve been looking</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.400" end="00:01:49.600" style="s2">for?</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.600" end="00:01:51.700" style="s2">Who said you could give her food?</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.600" end="00:01:55.000" style="s2">Morgan said she brings luck. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.700" end="00:01:58.000" style="s2">Six years, not one good thing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.000" end="00:02:00.392" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll just take Isabella&#39;s baby.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.000" end="00:02:02.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It won&#39;t work. That power only works if</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.392" end="00:02:06.192" style="s2">truly love the child.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.192" end="00:02:07.892" style="s2">Take her by force and it&#39;ll backfire.</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.192" end="00:02:10.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She looks more and more like that [ __ ]</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.892" end="00:02:10.492" style="s2">Isabella.</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.792" end="00:02:15.392" style="s2">Little Jinx, want to go out and play?</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.292" end="00:02:18.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want to go.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.392" end="00:02:18.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get a say.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.092" end="00:02:29.092" style="s2">You stand right here and wait for me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.792" end="00:02:32.692" style="s2">I&#39;ll be back soon. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.092" end="00:02:32.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, can I come with you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.092" end="00:02:38.692" style="s2">Mommy,</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.092" end="00:02:41.292" style="s2">don&#39;t leave me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.692" end="00:02:44.192" style="s2">I&#39;ll be good, I promise. I won&#39;t eat</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.292" end="00:02:44.192" style="s2">ever again.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.371" end="00:02:48.391" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.192" end="00:02:56.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t cry. Mommy hates it when I cry.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.492" end="00:03:01.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother, someone&#39;s there.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.192" end="00:03:05.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Mark.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
